WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:05.082
When a customer rings wanting a price today, speed and clarity win the work.

2
00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:09.697
Leave pricing till the evening, and the first clear reply takes the booking.

3
00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:16.213
With reloops, you price on your own rates and send on the same day.

4
00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:24.603
For smaller or hourly jobs, open Quick Quote and pick two men and a Luton at eighty-five pounds an hour.

5
00:00:25.403 --> 00:00:32.538
Set six hours for five hundred and ten pounds plus VAT, with the deposit worked out, ready for WhatsApp, text, or email.

6
00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:41.595
Full house moves price straight from your rate card: crew hours, mileage, packing materials, and Saturday uplift.

7
00:00:42.395 --> 00:00:49.174
Minimum job fees and transit cover are included, with price, cost, and margin side by side for your office.

8
00:00:52.854 --> 00:00:57.761
Preview the page as your customer sees it, and add optional full packing they can tick.

9
00:00:58.561 --> 00:01:01.753
You stay in charge, and nothing goes out until you press Send.

10
00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:08.131
On their phone, your customer checks the breakdown, ticks packing, and signs with a finger.

11
00:01:08.931 --> 00:01:13.021
They see how to pay the deposit, and the move shows Accepted in your office.

12
00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:19.763
Your own rates, sent on the same day. Book a fifteen-minute call on our website.
